  "as_of_notes": "Active voter counts as reported in the Statewide Election Management System (SEMS) maintained by county election officials. The MS SOS Elections Division pulls the ACTIVE voter count on the first Monday of every month; for the May 2026 report the first Monday was 2026-05-04. The report does not print an explicit 'as of' date on the document itself.",
  "data_quality": "high",
  "notes": "Source: Mississippi Secretary of State 'Active Voter Count Reports' page (https://www.sos.ms.gov/elections-voting/active-voter-count-reports), May 2026 PDF report. Figures are ACTIVE registered voters per SEMS (Mississippi does not report inactive voters or registration by party in this report; MS does not register voters by party). Statewide total (1,873,828) is the sum of all 82 county active voter counts; the PDF itself lists only per-county figures (county, CVAP estimate, active voters, percentage) and does not print a statewide total or a date on the document. County FIPS codes added from standard Census codes. 'Jefferson Davis' is listed as 'Jeff Davis' in the source."
